DESCRIPTION:Dijkstra said programming was\, "a practical exercise in the ef
 fective exploitation of one’s powers of abstraction". Such powers of abs
 traction depend on what\, why and how we pay attention to the world. My ta
 lk will be a thought provoking\, creative and (hopefully) entertaining exp
 loration of how we use (and misuse) Python to express ourselves.
